1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,671
Why do Americans write color without a u?

2
00:00:02,671 --> 00:00:04,500
Because of one man, and one book.

3
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:11,077
In eighteen twenty eight, Noah Webster published An American Dictionary of the English Language.

4
00:00:11,077 --> 00:00:13,766
Two volumes, and about seventy thousand entries.

5
00:00:14,966 --> 00:00:16,620
He pushed simpler spellings.

6
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:17,801
Colour became color.

7
00:00:17,801 --> 00:00:19,041
Centre became center.

8
00:00:19,041 --> 00:00:23,766
And that is why, today, British and American English look different on the page.

